  concept: "Authored objective: Review borderline and reject glare.\nAuthored requirement:
    Recorded from the solved sensor voltage and the sorting trial. voltage \u2265
    4.8 V. voltage \u2264 5.2 V.\nGeneral teaching principle: Electrical measurements
    are differences or flows that require a correct reference, operating condition
    and fresh solver evidence.\nOnly fresh, authoritative game evidence can establish
    that this objective is complete."
